<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague second preliminary round matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group G</p>
<p>Sevilla (Spain) 91 Villeurbanne (France) 68 (40-38)</p>
<p>Pau-Orthez (France) 66 Panathinaikos (Greece) 78 (32-33)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Pau - Lawrence Fundeburke 27, Frederic Fauthoux 14, Thierry Gadou 9</p>
<p>Panathinaikos - Hugo Sconochini 24, Byron Dinkins 20, Nikos Ekonomou 13</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p>Barcelona (Spain) 91 Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 67 (halftime 36-30)</p>
</text>
